  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.11\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* fix: ask the user to choose a party again when the party selection can't be used, instead of failing with 500 by @vxkc in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1858\n* fix: include the path of the invalid field in XSD validation issues by @ivarne-agent in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1859\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.10...v8.12.11",
